      <documentation>-- Definition --
A modeling entity where issues with data quality are identified.
-- Description --
For example, the identification of specific known problems in the data that could not be fixed within the context of the dataset delivery. This feature indicates to the user the potential need for caution when utilizing any data that touches, crosses, or exists within the identified location.</documentation>
