-- Description --
May be used to allow for the flexible capture of feature instances that are unanticipated at the time of specifying the feature type domain. This ensures that feature instances deemed important for a particular mission and/or user can be captured, even though the most appropriate feature type is not used.</documentation>
    </annotation>
