Includes pavements and shoulders.
-- UnitOfMeasure --
metre</documentation>
            </annotation>
          </element>
          <element minOccurs="0" name="safeHorizontalClearance" type="nydatakilde:MeasureMetaPropertyType">
            <annotation>
              <documentation>-- Definition --
Minimum safe horizontal distance between adjacent structures on either side of a navigable channel.
